The new curriculum

Instead of my earlier 20-day list, I'd make this six stages.

STAGE I — Instruction Fundamentals

Level 1 — Intent

Learn to identify:

> What exactly am I asking for?



Level 2 — Scope

Learn:

> What is included and excluded?



Level 3 — Inputs

Learn:

> What information/artifacts does the agent have permission to use?



Level 4 — Actions

Learn:

> What exactly should it do?



Level 5 — Outputs

Learn:

> What constitutes a complete answer?



Level 6 — Constraints

Learn:

> What must it NOT do?



Level 7 — Stop conditions

Learn:

> When must it stop instead of improvising?




