Level 9 — Atomic requirements

One requirement should not secretly contain five requirements.

NASA specifically recommends that individual requirements express one thought and be independently verifiable. 

You'll practice splitting:

> "Inspect, repair, test, optimize, document, and commit the project."



into separate controlled requirements.


